OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FJitka visits the surgery with
OL,7,     Fexcruciating back pain. Desperate
OL,8,     Ffor pain relief, she's taken some
OL,9,     Ftramadol given to her by a friend
OL,10,     F- a dangerous thing to do.
OL,11,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,12,     FA three-year-old who cut his lip
OL,13,     Fmight need treatment by specialist
OL,14,     Ffacial doctors in Sheffield. And a
OL,15,     Fconsultant doctor must assess
OL,16,     Fwhether Les has had a stroke.
